sequenceDiagram
  participant Host as Rule host
  participant Evidence as Evidence owner
  participant B as Supplied library repo B
  participant A as Supplied consumer repo A
  Note over Host,A: Proposed-only with no predecessor. Relationships remain candidates
  Host->>Evidence: Per-repo scopes and admitted fixed-capability query
  Evidence->>B: Resolve changes and capture definition sides
  B-->>Evidence: Frozen bytes, revisions and change provenance
  Evidence->>Evidence: AST locates changed unit and basis spans
  loop Unvisited in-scope candidates within resource limits
    Evidence->>A: Capture unchanged possible caller source
    A-->>Evidence: Frozen consumer bytes and repository identity
    Evidence->>Evidence: Reuse AST for imports, calls and shadows
    Evidence->>Evidence: Record candidate or unresolved link and contradictions
  end
  Evidence->>Evidence: Check capture stability and record frontier/cutoffs
  alt Required source unavailable or query limited
    Evidence-->>Host: Partial group and diagnostics, no required-context readiness
  else Requested source scope scanned
    Evidence-->>Host: Located group or unresolved endpoint outcome
  end
  Note over Host,Evidence: Host declares required context. Evidence owns source grouping, not rule policy
